{"seq":1,"slug":"modules-signatures-functors","title":"模块、签名与函子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/modules-signatures-functors","wordCount":1201,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块-签名与函子\">模块、签名与函子</h1><p>OCaml 的模块系统将代码组织为具有明确接口的独立单元，并通过函子（Functor）实现参数化抽象。这套机制的核心设计目标是：在不牺牲类型安全的前提下，为大规模代码库提供信息隐藏、代码复用和独立编译的能力。Jane Street 超过 3000 万行的 OCaml 代码库证明了这一设计在工业规模下的可行性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OCaml 的模块系统让代码在保持类型安全的同时具备清晰的接口边界，其能力可归纳为四条核心命题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>值、类型、子模块的集合，对应一个实现单元</td>\n<td>每个 <code>.ml</code> 文件本身就是一个模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名</td>\n<td>描述模块对外可见内容的接口</td>\n<td>用 <code>: SIG</code> 密封即可隐藏内部表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函子</td>\n<td>从模块到模块的函数，接受满足签名的参数</td>\n<td><code>Map.Make</code>/<code>Set.Make</code> 由此实现参数化复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包含</td>\n<td><code>include</code>/<code>with type</code> 组合与精化签名</td>\n<td>以组合而非继承的方式叠加与暴露能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：签名定义「能看到什么」，函子定义「如何按参数生成模块」，两者共同支撑了 OCaml 在大规模代码库中的信息隐藏与代码复用。下面依次展开结构与签名、函子、高阶函子、递归模块，以及 <code>.mli</code> 这一编译单元层面的模块化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模块基础-结构与签名\">模块基础：结构与签名</h2><p>模块（module / structure）是值、类型和子模块的集合。签名（signature / module type）描述模块的接口——哪些内容对外可见：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type STACK = sig&#10;  type &#39;a t&#10;  val empty : &#39;a t&#10;  val push : &#39;a -&gt; &#39;a t -&gt; &#39;a t&#10;  val pop : &#39;a t -&gt; (&#39;a * &#39;a t) option&#10;  val size : &#39;a t -&gt; int&#10;end&#10;&#10;module List_stack : STACK = struct&#10;  type &#39;a t = &#39;a list&#10;  let empty = []&#10;  let push x s = x :: s&#10;  let pop = function&#10;    | [] -&gt; None&#10;    | x :: rest -&gt; Some (x, rest)&#10;  let size = List.length&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type STACK = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val empty : 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val push : 'a -> 'a t -> 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val pop : 'a t -> ('a * 'a t) option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val size : 'a t -> int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module List_stack : STACK = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a t = 'a list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let empty = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let push x s = x :: s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let pop = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | [] -> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | x :: rest -> Some (x, rest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let size = List.length</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>签名密封（sealing）通过 <code>: SIG</code> 语法隐藏实现细节。密封后，外部代码只能通过签名声明的操作访问模块——<code>List_stack.t</code> 的内部表示（<code>&#39;a list</code>）对外不可见。</p>\n<p>关键的签名操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>透明约束</td>\n<td><code>M : S with type t = int</code></td>\n<td>暴露类型等式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破坏性替换</td>\n<td><code>S with type t := int</code></td>\n<td>移除类型声明，内联替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块替换</td>\n<td><code>S with module M := N</code></td>\n<td>用现有模块替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名包含</td>\n<td><code>include S</code></td>\n<td>将 S 中所有声明引入当前签名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type MAP = sig&#10;  type key&#10;  type &#39;a t&#10;  val empty : &#39;a t&#10;  val add : key -&gt; &#39;a -&gt; &#39;a t -&gt; &#39;a t&#10;  val find_opt : key -&gt; &#39;a t -&gt; &#39;a option&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* with type 暴露 key 的具体类型 *)&#10;module type INT_MAP = MAP with type key = int\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type MAP = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val empty : 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val add : key -> 'a -> 'a t -> 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val find_opt : key -> 'a t -> 'a option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* with type 暴露 key 的具体类型 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type INT_MAP = MAP with type key = int</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"函子-参数化模块\">函子：参数化模块</h2><p>函子是从模块到模块的函数——接受一个满足特定签名的模块作为参数，产出一个新模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type COMPARABLE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val compare : t -&gt; t -&gt; int&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Make_set (Elt : COMPARABLE) : sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val empty : t&#10;  val add : Elt.t -&gt; t -&gt; t&#10;  val mem : Elt.t -&gt; t -&gt; bool&#10;  val to_list : t -&gt; Elt.t list&#10;end = struct&#10;  type t = Elt.t list&#10;&#10;  let empty = []&#10;&#10;  let rec add x = function&#10;    | [] -&gt; [x]&#10;    | h :: _ as l when Elt.compare x h &lt; 0 -&gt; x :: l&#10;    | h :: t when Elt.compare x h &gt; 0 -&gt; h :: add x t&#10;    | l -&gt; l&#10;&#10;  let rec mem x = function&#10;    | [] -&gt; false&#10;    | h :: _ when Elt.compare x h = 0 -&gt; true&#10;    | h :: t when Elt.compare x h &gt; 0 -&gt; mem x t&#10;    | _ -&gt; false&#10;&#10;  let to_list s = s&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type COMPARABLE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val compare : t -> t -> int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Make_set (Elt : COMPARABLE) : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val empty : t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val add : Elt.t -> t -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val mem : Elt.t -> t -> bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val to_list : t -> Elt.t list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = Elt.t list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let empty = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let rec add x = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | [] -> [x]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | h :: _ as l when Elt.compare x h &#x3C; 0 -> x :: l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | h :: t when Elt.compare x h > 0 -> h :: add x t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | l -> l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let rec mem x = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | [] -> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | h :: _ when Elt.compare x h = 0 -> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | h :: t when Elt.compare x h > 0 -> mem x t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | _ -> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let to_list s = s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>函子应用创建具体模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module Int_comparable = struct&#10;  type t = int&#10;  let compare = Int.compare&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Int_set = Make_set(Int_comparable)&#10;&#10;let s = Int_set.(empty |&gt; add 3 |&gt; add 1 |&gt; add 2)&#10;(* Int_set.to_list s = [1; 2; 3] *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module Int_comparable = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let compare = Int.compare</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Int_set = Make_set(Int_comparable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = Int_set.(empty |> add 3 |> add 1 |> add 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* Int_set.to_list s = [1; 2; 3] *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>标准库的 <code>Map.Make</code>、<code>Set.Make</code>、<code>Hashtbl.Make</code> 都是函子的经典应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 函子应用&#10;        A[COMPARABLE 签名] --&gt; F[Make_set 函子]&#10;        B[Int_comparable 模块] --&gt; F&#10;        F --&gt; C[Int_set 模块]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 生成的模块&#10;        C --&gt; D[type t = 抽象]&#10;        C --&gt; E[&quot;add : int -&gt; t -&gt; t&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; G[&quot;mem : int -&gt; t -&gt; bool&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 函子应用\n        A[COMPARABLE 签名] --&gt; F[Make_set 函子]\n        B[Int_comparable 模块] --&gt; F\n        F --&gt; C[Int_set 模块]\n    end\n    subgraph 生成的模块\n        C --&gt; D[type t = 抽象]\n        C --&gt; E[\"add : int -&gt; t -&gt; t\"]\n        C --&gt; G[\"mem : int -&gt; t -&gt; bool\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"高阶函子与函子组合\">高阶函子与函子组合</h2><p>函子可以接受其他函子作为参数（高阶函子），也可以相互组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type SERIALIZABLE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val to_string : t -&gt; string&#10;  val of_string : string -&gt; t&#10;end&#10;&#10;module type PERSISTENT_SET = sig&#10;  include module type of Set.Make(Int)  (* 继承 Set 的全部操作 *)&#10;  val save : t -&gt; string&#10;  val load : string -&gt; t&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Make_persistent_set&#10;  (Elt : sig&#10;    include COMPARABLE&#10;    include SERIALIZABLE with type t := t&#10;  end) : PERSISTENT_SET = struct&#10;  include Set.Make(Elt)&#10;&#10;  let save s =&#10;    to_list s&#10;    |&gt; List.map Elt.to_string&#10;    |&gt; String.concat &quot;\\n&quot;&#10;&#10;  let load str =&#10;    String.split_on_char &#39;\\n&#39; str&#10;    |&gt; List.map Elt.of_string&#10;    |&gt; List.fold_left (fun acc x -&gt; add x acc) empty&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type SERIALIZABLE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val to_string : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val of_string : string -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type PERSISTENT_SET = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include module type of Set.Make(Int)  (* 继承 Set 的全部操作 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val save : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val load : string -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Make_persistent_set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (Elt : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    include COMPARABLE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    include SERIALIZABLE with type t := t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end) : PERSISTENT_SET = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include Set.Make(Elt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let save s =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    to_list s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    |> List.map Elt.to_string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    |> String.concat \"\\n\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let load str =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    String.split_on_char '\\n' str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    |> List.map Elt.of_string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    |> List.fold_left (fun acc x -> add x acc) empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"递归模块\">递归模块</h2><p>OCaml 支持递归模块定义——两个模块可以互相引用。这在定义相互依赖的数据结构时必不可少：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module rec Tree : sig&#10;  type t = Leaf | Node of { value : int; children : Forest.t }&#10;end = struct&#10;  type t = Leaf | Node of { value : int; children : Forest.t }&#10;end&#10;&#10;and Forest : sig&#10;  type t = Tree.t list&#10;  val depth : t -&gt; int&#10;end = struct&#10;  type t = Tree.t list&#10;&#10;  let rec depth = function&#10;    | [] -&gt; 0&#10;    | trees -&gt; 1 + List.fold_left&#10;        (fun acc t -&gt; match t with&#10;          | Tree.Leaf -&gt; acc&#10;          | Tree.Node { children; _ } -&gt; max acc (depth children))&#10;        0 trees&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module rec Tree : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = Leaf | Node of { value : int; children : Forest.t }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = Leaf | Node of { value : int; children : Forest.t }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and Forest : sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = Tree.t list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val depth : t -> int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = Tree.t list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let rec depth = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | [] -> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | trees -> 1 + List.fold_left</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (fun acc t -> match t with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          | Tree.Leaf -> acc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          | Tree.Node { children; _ } -> max acc (depth children))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0 trees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>递归模块要求提供完整的签名注解——编译器需要知道每个模块的接口才能处理递归引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ml-与-mli-编译单元的模块化\">.ml 与 .mli：编译单元的模块化</h2><p>OCaml 的编译单元本身就是模块。每个 <code>.ml</code> 文件隐式定义一个模块，对应的 <code>.mli</code> 文件是其签名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* stack.mli — 签名文件 *)&#10;type &#39;a t&#10;val empty : &#39;a t&#10;val push : &#39;a -&gt; &#39;a t -&gt; &#39;a t&#10;val pop : &#39;a t -&gt; (&#39;a * &#39;a t) option&#10;&#10;(* stack.ml — 实现文件 *)&#10;type &#39;a t = &#39;a list&#10;let empty = []&#10;let push x s = x :: s&#10;let pop = function&#10;  | [] -&gt; None&#10;  | x :: rest -&gt; Some (x, rest)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* stack.mli — 签名文件 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val empty : 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val push : 'a -> 'a t -> 'a t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val pop : 'a t -> ('a * 'a t) option</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* stack.ml — 实现文件 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type 'a t = 'a list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let empty = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let push x s = x :: s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let pop = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | [] -> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | x :: rest -> Some (x, rest)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>必须性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>foo.ml</code></td>\n<td>实现（结构体）</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>foo.mli</code></td>\n<td>接口（签名）</td>\n<td>可选但强烈推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>foo.cmi</code></td>\n<td>编译后接口</td>\n<td>编译器生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>foo.cmo</code> / <code>foo.cmx</code></td>\n<td>字节码/原生目标</td>\n<td>编译器生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>为什么 <code>.mli</code> 文件至关重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信息隐藏</strong>：不写 <code>.mli</code> 的模块默认导出所有内容</li>\n<li><strong>独立编译</strong>：依赖方只需要 <code>.cmi</code> 即可编译，无需等待实现</li>\n<li><strong>文档化</strong>：签名是最权威的 API 文档</li>\n<li><strong>编译加速</strong>：修改 <code>.ml</code> 但不改 <code>.mli</code> 时，依赖方无需重编译</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"include-与-open-的区别\">include 与 open 的区别</h2><p>两个常被混淆的模块操作有本质区别：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* open：将模块内容引入当前命名空间（仅影响名字解析） *)&#10;open List&#10;let doubled = map (fun x -&gt; x * 2) [1; 2; 3]&#10;&#10;(* include：将模块内容复制到当前模块中（成为当前模块的一部分） *)&#10;module Extended_list = struct&#10;  include List  (* 继承 List 的所有绑定 *)&#10;  let hd_opt = function [] -&gt; None | x :: _ -&gt; Some x&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* open：将模块内容引入当前命名空间（仅影响名字解析） *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>open List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let doubled = map (fun x -> x * 2) [1; 2; 3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* include：将模块内容复制到当前模块中（成为当前模块的一部分） *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Extended_list = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include List  (* 继承 List 的所有绑定 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let hd_opt = function [] -> None | x :: _ -> Some x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>include</code> 在构建扩展模块（mixin 模式）时不可或缺：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type BASE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val compare : t -&gt; t -&gt; int&#10;end&#10;&#10;module type WITH_EQUAL = sig&#10;  include BASE&#10;  val equal : t -&gt; t -&gt; bool&#10;end&#10;&#10;module Add_equal (B : BASE) : WITH_EQUAL with type t = B.t = struct&#10;  include B&#10;  let equal a b = compare a b = 0&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type BASE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val compare : t -> t -> int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module type WITH_EQUAL = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include BASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val equal : t -> t -> bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Add_equal (B : BASE) : WITH_EQUAL with type t = B.t = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  include B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let equal a b = compare a b = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>结构 + 签名 = 实现 + 接口</strong>：密封后外部只能通过签名声明的操作访问模块，内部表示对外不可见。</li>\n<li><strong>函子实现参数化复用</strong>：<code>Make_set</code> 这类从模块到模块的函数让容器等结构一次编写、按元素类型反复实例化，<code>Map.Make</code>/<code>Set.Make</code> 是其经典应用。</li>\n<li><strong>签名操作是精化的杠杆</strong>：<code>with type</code> 暴露类型等式、<code>:=</code> 做破坏性替换、<code>include</code> 引入声明，共同支撑透明、部分抽象与继承式组合。</li>\n<li><strong>递归模块处理互相依赖</strong>：<code>module rec ... and ...</code> 要求完整签名注解，因为编译器需先知道每个模块的接口才能处理递归引用。</li>\n<li><strong><code>.mli</code> 不是可选项</strong>：它同时提供信息隐藏、独立编译、API 文档与增量编译加速四项收益——不写 <code>.mli</code> 的模块默认导出全部内容。</li>\n<li><strong>复用靠组合而非继承</strong>：<code>include</code> + functor 的 mixin 模式以静态分派、类型安全、零运行时开销的方式叠加能力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套「组合优于继承」的思路，也是后面一等公民模块与抽象封装模式共同的技术底色。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模块、签名与函子","id":"模块-签名与函子"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模块基础：结构与签名","id":"模块基础-结构与签名"},{"level":2,"text":"函子：参数化模块","id":"函子-参数化模块"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶函子与函子组合","id":"高阶函子与函子组合"},{"level":2,"text":"递归模块","id":"递归模块"},{"level":2,"text":".ml 与 .mli：编译单元的模块化","id":"ml-与-mli-编译单元的模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"include 与 open 的区别","id":"include-与-open-的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GADT 与幻影类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/gadt-phantom-types"},"next":{"title":"一等公民模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/first-class-modules"}}